# Canonical identities for git log / shortlog / blame.
#
# Commits reached this repo through two channels that stamped different
# addresses: local commits used the machine's git identity, PRs squash-merged
# through GitHub used the account's noreply address. Both are the same person.
# This file collapses them so `git shortlog -sne`, generated changelogs and
# CONTRIBUTORS lists show one author instead of three.
#
# Format: <canonical name> <canonical email> <email seen in history>
# Note: GitHub's web UI and contribution graph do not read .mailmap — they
# resolve authorship from the verified addresses on the account instead.

Pavel Srba <srba@unify.cz> <46597712+Srbino@users.noreply.github.com>
